  "bear_maw": {
    "_src": "15cbd3de3e",
    "name": "Bear Maw",
    "system.description": "<p>The maw of a large predator: step III of the Damage Ladder. Natural weapon: can't be disarmed and doesn't occupy the hands.</p>"
  },
  "chimera_specimen_maw": {
    "_src": "471a2f9917",
    "name": "Specimen Maw",
    "system.description": "<p>A dog's maw set crookedly: step II of the Damage Ladder. Natural weapon: can't be disarmed and doesn't occupy the hands.</p><p>It isn't the maw that grabs but the specimen's <strong>human hands</strong>: mechanically it's Jaw Lock, in fact it's fingers at the throat.</p>"
  },
  "chimera_watch_claws": {
    "_src": "538efc9502",
    "name": "Warden Claws",
    "system.description": "<p>Bear claws with a horse's strength: step III. A cheap slashing strike for Claw Slash.</p><p><strong>Control Zone 1</strong>: it also carries the creature's size-based Control. The system reads CZ from the equipped melee weapon; the actor has no separate size field.</p>"
  },
  "chimera_watch_maw": {
    "_src": "26c2b35c33",
    "name": "Warden Maw",
    "system.description": "<p>The guard chimera's main weapon: step IV, one step above the rank 3 row. This is what “hits hard” means: an elite buys a half-rank up in damage.</p><p><strong>Control Zone 1</strong>: it also carries the creature's size-based Control. The system reads CZ from the equipped melee weapon; the actor has no separate size field.</p>"
  },
